\section{Why OTH is retained}{

At an A>G site the two remaining bases can only be sequencing error, so OTH/DP
is an internal, position-matched error floor for the AD/DP signal. Comparing
the two is what separates a real editing signal from a base-calling artifact.
On the 2026-08-12 editing pilot the ratio was 7.4x (TBX3) and 9.5x (CLAD-2).
}

